ile-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_LOW_CountingHouse_Vault4_Key</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_CountingHouse_Vault4_Key\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_CountingHouse_Vault4_Key\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">761d5d86-ecc1-455e-925f-271e4ab5dcc4</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:761d5d86-ecc1-455e-925f-271e4ab5dcc4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:761d5d86-ecc1-455e-925f-271e4ab5dcc4\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In an <a href=\"/wiki/Opulent_Chest\" title=\"Opulent Chest\">Opulent Chest</a> on the second floor of the <a href=\"/wiki/Water_Queen%27s_House\" title=\"Water Queen's House\">Water Queen's House</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-247&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-249</span></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Unlocks <b>High Security Vault nº4</b>  in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House\" title=\"The Counting House\">The Counting House</a> - High Security Vaults, which contains <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trident_of_the_Waves\" title=\"Trident of the Waves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Allandra%27s_Whelm_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Allandra%27s_Whelm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Allandra%27s_Whelm_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Allandra%27s_Whelm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Allandra%27s_Whelm_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Allandra%27s_Whelm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Allandra%27s_Whelm_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Allandra%27s_Whelm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Allandra%27s_Whelm_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Trident_of_the_Waves\" title=\"Trident of the Waves\">Trident of the Waves</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See <a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House#Loot\" title=\"The Counting House\">The Counting House</a> for a list of key locations</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200333\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1729/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26776/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6483/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000